graph","text":"そして昨日質問返ししてなかった\nので今日返しますね( •ㅈ• )おまたせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ゆったんはどんなとこで\n買い物するのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んー新宿 渋谷 原宿ですね‼\n大体うろうろしてます。\n斉藤優里を探せ え。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ゆったんは何か楽器出来る？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.前までピアノやってたけど\nもう出来ない。それに生ちゃんが\nいるから(´;ω;`)う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ゆったんは変態な女の子\n好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.え、勿論仲間です( •ㅈ• )びし\n話あうよー絶対。お喋りしたい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.寝てる時は口閉じてるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んー寝てるとき。寝顔ハンター\nかなりんに聞いてくださいw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きなお寿司のネタは～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.サーモン一択に限る‼\nサーモンにだっていっぱい\n種類あるもんね( •ㅈ• )へ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ゆったんが可愛い‼\nて思う女の人は⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.お人形さんみたいな顔の人♡\nそんな顔に生まれたかったよ\nどうしてこんなに出っ歯にw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.車のほうが好きなのに、\n仕事で飛行機を作ってます。\nなぜですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ちゃんとお仕事してね♡\n飛行機も似合うさ‼どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.自分をポケモンで例えるなら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んーそりゃあねーーーパチリス\nパチリス以外いないでしょ( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.もし一つだけ無人島に\n持っていくなら何ですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.眼鏡‼だってめちゃくちゃ\n目悪いんだもん( •ㅈ• )ぐへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.次の握手会から優里って\n呼んでもいいかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.全然どうぞ♡♡\n優里って読ばせてあげようwえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーてと明日は美容院に行って\nカラーとカットしてきます♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね秋だからちょっと\n暗めに染めてくる‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来上がりはまたぶろぐに\n載せるから良かったらみてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/9828736/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪が流行ってるからきおつけてね\nちゃんと手洗いうがい(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がらがらぺっーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18687":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん こんにちわ ..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわむら まひろ、ろってぃーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/30/7832048/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/30/7832048/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-  &  まりか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/30/7832048/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裸眼です(゜▽゜*)って感じの顔してる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねっ!!  まりか？\nお気に入りのツーショット。えいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/30/7832048/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t